  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1">Failing tests first: (a) button opens a SprkModal, Cancel closes it → focus on the button; (b) ConfirmModal opened from a button inside a SprkModal, Keep (cancel) → focus on that button; (c) same with a conditionally mounted ConfirmModal (DecisionWizard shape). Show they fail on master.</step>
    <step order="2">Implement with the shared helper.</step>
    <step order="3">Negative tests: opener removed or disabled → no throw, focus not forced; host moved focus to another element outside the modal before close → not moved; `hidden` toggle and yield on/off → no restore.</step>
    <step order="4">Filtered jest (SprkModal/**, presets, DecisionWizard, RuleWizard, WizardShell, EmailComposer), typecheck, client-lint; bump/build PCFs whose bundle changes; build the Console.</step>
    <step order="5">Notes in notes/task-202-notes.md (cause, ordering evidence, fail-before, versions).</step>
  </steps>
  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Test (a), (b), (c) pass and fail on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative tests in step 3 pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Test: triage category Edit moves focus to the Name field; Cancel returns it to that row's Edit button. Fails on origin/master.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Existing tests unmodified and passing; typecheck; client-lint; builds as stated.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="false">Main session verifies on dev after the Console auto-deploys: the three dev paths in the prompt end on the opener.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
  <escalation>
